"Author" means doktordestrukt (aka ellie), the copyright holder.

"Software" means everything in the Official Repository: the BloodTrail
Together source code, compiled binaries (including btt_core.dll and the
installer), Lua scripts, tools, tests, artwork and documentation, in any
version, and any part, translation, port or compiled, decompiled or
disassembled form of them.

"Official Repository" means the GitHub repository the Author publishes the
Software in, and its GitHub release pages.

"Modified Version" means anything that copies, changes, adapts, translates,
ports, rebuilds, recompiles or patches the Software or any part of it, or is
derived from it, in source or binary form.

"User Content" means anything that is not part of the Software, including
other mods, configuration, names, outfits, chat, voice, gameplay and anything
else other players send, show or do while using the Software.

"Distribute" means to make available to anyone other than yourself by any
means, including uploading, hosting, mirroring, re-uploading, attaching,
bundling, sharing a link to a copy that is not in the Official Repository,
or including the Software in a modpack, installer, mod manager or other
package.

